{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中國平安上半年多賺三成六，有純利925.8億元人民幣。派中期息每股0.98元人民幣，按年增加約百分之3。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期內收入6,153億元人民幣，上升逾一成二。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T00:19:29.535934+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":75,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}